      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it (Order ID: ORD-0001):\n\n- **Drug and dose:** sertraline 400 mg by mouth, once daily\n- **Note on the order:** says the dose is above the labeled maximum of 200 mg/day, that you reviewed the alert, and that you confirmed the dose. It also recommends pharmacy verification.\n\nBecause the dose is high, I'd suggest these steps:\n- Let your attending and pharmacy know, since they may call you about it.\n- Check the patient's other medications for serotonergic drugs or QT-prolonging drugs.\n- Consider a baseline ECG.\n- Monitor for serotonin toxicity, GI bleeding, hyponatremia, and activation or agitation.\n\nI can adjust or replace the order if the plan changes."
